      "id": "G-TD13-001",
      "set": "G-TD13",
      "jp": {
        "number": "G-TD13/001",
        "name": "閻魔忍竜 キンゴクテンブ",
        "text": "（Ｇユニットはメインデッキに入れることができない）\n【超越】（お互いのヴァンガードがグレード３以上で解放！）-ストライドステップ-[あなたの手札からグレードの合計が３以上になるように１枚以上選び、捨てる]裏のこのカードを(V)に【超越】する。\n（超越した時、ハーツ１枚のパワーとカード名を得る。このユニットは、ターンの終わりに表で戻る）\n支配-【自】【(V)】：あなたのバトルフェイズ開始時、相手のリアガードを１枚まで選び、【スタンド】して支配し、相手の他のユニットにアタックする。（あなたがコストを払えば能力も使える）",
        "clan": "ぬばたま",
        "race": "アビスドラゴン",
        "image": "/wordpress/wp-content/images/cardlist/G-TD13/gtd13_001.png"
      },
      "en": {
        "number": "G-TD13/001EN",
        "name": "Enma Stealth Dragon, Kingoku Tenbu",
        "text": "(This card cannot be in your main deck)\n[Stride](Released when both players' vanguards are grade 3 or greater!)-Stride Step-[Choose one or more cards with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater from your hand, and discard them] [Stride] this card on your (VC) from face down.\n(When this card strides, it gains the power and card name of one heart. At the end of the turn, return it face up)\nDominate-[AUTO](VC):At the beginning of your battle phase, choose up to one of your opponent's rear-guards, [Stand] and dominate it, and attack your opponent's other unit. (You may use its abilities if you pay the cost)",
        "clan": "Nubatama",
        "race": "Abyss Dragon",
        "image": "/wordpress/wp-content/images/cardlist/gtd13/GTD13_001EN.jpg"
      },
      "cardType": "g_unit",
